    "description": "MAGENTA-009 (MagentaCloud Windows software): the installer demanded more free disk than the whole 500 GB plan, synced '0 of N' and then wrote to C: although D: was chosen. Rule E3: room is measured per download against the bytes actually needed plus the reserve, never against the quota; every write stays in the pairing's folder. sync-chaos sec-share-quota-dos.",
